{"4028820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Citizen Vigilante", "steam_appid": 4028820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When the system fails, justice becomes personal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city consumed by crime. A system pushed to its limits. People are losing faith. You are Sanders — not a hero, not a savior, but a man who decided to act. Take justice into your own hands, hunt down criminals, uncover corruption, and face the consequences of your actions. Some will call you a hero. Others will call you a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The official game based on the film by Uwe Boll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal, fast-paced action combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gritty, violent gameplay with gore and dismemberment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven vigilante experience</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When the system fails, justice becomes personal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city consumed by crime. A system pushed to its limits. People are losing faith. You are Sanders — not a hero, not a savior, but a man who decided to act. Take justice into your own hands, hunt down criminals, uncover corruption, and face the consequences of your actions. Some will call you a hero. Others will call you a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The official game based on the film by Uwe Boll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal, fast-paced action combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gritty, violent gameplay with gore and dismemberment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven vigilante experience</p></li></ul>", "sh